{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-09-24T01:17:36.291586Z", "id": "github:release:672651553:release:394335005", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 465, "prerelease": true, "stars": 3757, "stars_delta": 10, "tag_name": "model-moge3-v1"}, "organization": "MrNeRF", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-09-23T06:07:32Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "672651553:release:394335005", "summary": "MoGe-3 ViT-L base weights in the native `.lfw` format, the default depth model of the SLAM pipeline and the `preprocess` CLI. Marked as pre-release only to keep it out of the Latest badge; this is a permanent model asset, not an app release.\n\n- Source: [microsoft/MoGe](https://github.com/microsoft/MoGe) at `74fbce054ebed49800de42d0ad0e83495065719a`, MIT, (c) Microsoft Corporation\n- Weights: [Ruicheng/moge-3-vitl](https://huggingface.co/Ruicheng/moge-3-vitl) at `184008f877d7ad1ad4c2cd2182a9bd1f63d0e5be` (MIT), checkpoint sha256 `9b41b7b9f65ad80aab7ad686f5e9cc0d1fd33f1964022618dfbcd52fc1fb7925`\n- DINOv2 ViT-L/14 backbone components: [facebookresearch/dinov2](https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2), Apache-2.0, (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates\n- Converted from that checkpoint with the base model only: the unused sparse refiner tensors are omitted, 520 tensors, float16, run natively at 1,800 tokens.\n- sha256: `ac41d42e7b43de75b83fc0326339fdbdaa2c198418f852ff45c0e5dc31b51f6f`\n", "title": "MrNeRF/LichtFeld-Studio MoGe-3 ViT-L base weights", "topics": ["gaussian_splatting"], "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:07:32Z", "url": "https://github.com/MrNeRF/LichtFeld-Studio/releases/tag/model-moge3-v1", "venue": null}
